{"id":2114,"date":"2026-08-26T02:25:30","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T02:25:30","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2114"},"modified":"2026-08-26T08:29:11","modified_gmt":"2026-08-26T08:29:11","slug":"the-custom-colour-picker","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/extra-tips\/the-custom-colour-picker\/","title":{"rendered":"The Custom Colour Picker"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b; font-family: sans-serif;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\" style=\"color: #307870; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 0;\">The Custom Colour Picker<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2123\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheCustoColorPicker.webp\" alt=\"The Custom Colour Picker\" width=\"128\" height=\"131\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheCustoColorPicker.webp 896w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheCustoColorPicker-292x300.webp 292w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheCustoColorPicker-768x789.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Achieving the perfect visual aesthetic requires precise control over your palette. Open Publisher includes a professional-grade custom colour picker, intuitively accessible whenever you need to select a colour for text, backgrounds, geometric shapes, or page borders. Designed to accommodate both rapid prototyping and strict corporate design guidelines, it features a seamless tabbed interface that lets you instantly switch between a library of quick swatches and a full custom colour selection suite.<\/p>\n<p><!-- Combined Colour Picker Features Table (Minified) --><\/p>\n<div style=\"border: 2px solid #307870; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 0; background-color: #307870; line-height: 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; border-spacing: 0; border: none; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<thead style=\"background-color: #307870; color: #ffffff;\">\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 16px; font-weight: 600; border: none; width: 35%;\">Feature \/ Control<\/th>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 16px; font-weight: 600; border: none;\">Description<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f0ef;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border: none;\" colspan=\"2\">Interface Tabs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Swatches<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">A grid of predefined, vibrant preset colours. Perfect for rapid design work or maintaining a standard, consistent palette across basic documents.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Custom<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Unlocks the full manual colour selection toolset, giving you precise control over millions of colours for exact brand-matching (see controls below).<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f0ef;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border: none;\" colspan=\"2\">Professional Gradient Wheel<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">2D Saturation\/Brightness Canvas<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Click or drag your cursor anywhere on the interactive canvas to intuitively set your colour&#8217;s saturation (intensity) and brightness (lightness) simultaneously.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">1D Hue Slider<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Drag the slider to sweep through the full visible colour spectrum and select your foundational base hue before fine-tuning it on the 2D canvas.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f0ef;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border: none;\" colspan=\"2\">RGB &amp; Hex Inputs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Hex Input<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Type or paste a 6-character hex colour code directly (for example: <span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444;\">#007670<\/span>). Essential for web designers or adhering to strict corporate brand guidelines.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: none;\">RGB Inputs<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: none;\">Fine-tune the Red, Green, and Blue channels individually using precise number fields (0-255). All numerical inputs are synchronised in real time with the visual gradient picker, updating instantly as you type.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"western\" style=\"color: #307870; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Eyedropper Tool<\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2120\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EyedropperTool.webp\" alt=\"Eyedropper Tool\" width=\"128\" height=\"114\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;\">An integrated <strong>eyedropper tool<\/strong> is built directly into the colour picker interface, functioning as an indispensable asset for cohesive design. Use it to sample any colour currently visible on your screen and instantly apply it as your active selected colour. This is the ideal method for perfectly matching text or background colours to a specific hue found within a client&#8217;s logo, an imported reference photo, or an existing design element already sitting on your canvas.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\" style=\"color: #307870; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Smart Undo Fallback<\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2119\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SmartUndoFallback.webp\" alt=\"Smart Undo Fallback\" width=\"128\" height=\"135\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SmartUndoFallback.webp 411w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SmartUndoFallback-284x300.webp 284w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Nothing disrupts a creative workflow more than a broken undo function. The colour picker incorporates a sophisticated behind-the-scenes fix for a common browser limitation: normally, pressing <span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444;\">Ctrl+Z<\/span> while actively editing inside a text box would fail to undo broader canvas-level actions (like colour changes) if the browser&#8217;s internal text-undo history was empty. Open Publisher intelligently detects this trap and automatically falls back to the main canvas undo function. This ensures that <span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444;\">Ctrl+Z<\/span> always works flawlessly and predictably, reversing your last action regardless of where your cursor is currently focused.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2126 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-26_091828.png_202608260924.jpeg\" alt=\"Color Picker UI: Color Swatches | Custom Wheel\" width=\"1287\" height=\"816\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-26_091828.png_202608260924.jpeg 1287w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-26_091828.png_202608260924-300x190.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-26_091828.png_202608260924-1024x649.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-26_091828.png_202608260924-768x487.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1287px) 100vw, 1287px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Custom Colour Picker Achieving the perfect visual aesthetic requires precise control over your palette. Open Publisher includes a professional-grade custom colour picker, intuitively accessible whenever you need to select a colour for text, backgrounds, geometric shapes, or page borders. Designed to accommodate both rapid prototyping and strict corporate design guidelines, it features a seamless [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2123,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[25],"class_list":["post-2114","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-extra-tips"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2114","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2114"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2114\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2129,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2114\/revisions\/2129"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2123"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2114"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=2114"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}